<title>USA: USA Waste Services files $1.5 bln shelf.</title>
<headline>USA Waste Services files $1.5 bln shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>USA Waste Services Inc filed Wednesday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to register a shelf offering of up to $1.5 billion in debt securities and common shares.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the sale will be used for general corporate purposes, the company said in the shelf offering.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the filing.</p>
<p>-- Washington newsroom, ((202-898-8300))</p>
